{"id":"f153d56390f34389","group":"58","path":"58/batch20/58-df-zfc-inverse-relation.md","title":"ZFC Inverse Relation","display":"df-zfc-inverse-relation — ZFC Inverse Relation","type":"definition","metadata":{"type":"definition","book":"Set Theory","book_abbrev":"58","label":"58-df-zfc-inverse-relation","aliases":["58-df-zfc-inverse-relation","58-df-zfc-set10-inverse-relation","58-df-zfc-setop-inverse-relation"],"display":"df-zfc-inverse-relation — ZFC Inverse Relation","depends_on":["[[58-ax-zfc]]","[[58-df-relation]]"]},"metadataError":null,"renderWarnings":[],"properties":[{"key":"type","html":"definition"},{"key":"book","html":"Set Theory"},{"key":"book_abbrev","html":"58"},{"key":"label","html":"58-df-zfc-inverse-relation"},{"key":"aliases","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span>58-df-zfc-inverse-relation</span><span>58-df-zfc-set10-inverse-relation</span><span>58-df-zfc-setop-inverse-relation</span></div>"},{"key":"display","html":"df-zfc-inverse-relation — ZFC Inverse Relation"},{"key":"depends_on","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-1\" data-note=\"a3348ed9eb6fb4e3\" href=\"?note=a3348ed9eb6fb4e3\" title=\"58-ax-zfc\">58-ax-zfc</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-2\" data-note=\"7ccfc8c88f29968a\" href=\"?note=7ccfc8c88f29968a\" title=\"58-df-relation\">58-df-relation</a></span></div>"}],"html":"\n<h2 id=\"Hypothesis\">[Hypothesis]</h2>\n<ul>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"A,B,R,S\\in V\">\\(A,B,R,S\\in V\\)</span> (carrier sets and relation graphs)</li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"R^{-1}\\in V\">\\(R^{-1}\\in V\\)</span> (inverse-relation graph)</li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"x,y,a,b\\in V\">\\(x,y,a,b\\in V\\)</span> (relation coordinates bound in the assertions)</li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{InverseRelation}_S\">\\(\\mathrm{InverseRelation}_S\\)</span> (predicate defined here)</li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{ZfcSet10InverseRelation}_S\">\\(\\mathrm{ZfcSet10InverseRelation}_S\\)</span> (alias predicate defined here)</li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{ZfcSetopInverseRelation}_S\">\\(\\mathrm{ZfcSetopInverseRelation}_S\\)</span> (alias predicate defined here)</li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{Rel}_S\">\\(\\mathrm{Rel}_S\\)</span> (binary-relation predicate; see <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-3\" data-note=\"7ccfc8c88f29968a\" href=\"?note=7ccfc8c88f29968a\" title=\"58-df-relation\">58-df-relation</a>)</li>\n</ul>\n<h2 id=\"Assertion\">[Assertion]</h2>\n<figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{df\\text{-}zfc\\text{-}inverse\\text{-}relation} \\vdash \\mathrm{InverseRelation}_S(S,R,A,B)\\leftrightarrow\\mathrm{Rel}_S(R,A,B)\\land\\mathrm{Rel}_S(S,B,A)\\land\\forall x\\in A\\;\\forall y\\in B\\;(\\langle y,x\\rangle\\in S\\leftrightarrow\\langle x,y\\rangle\\in R)\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\mathrm{df\\text{-}zfc\\text{-}inverse\\text{-}relation} \\vdash \\mathrm{InverseRelation}_S(S,R,A,B)\\leftrightarrow\\mathrm{Rel}_S(R,A,B)\\land\\mathrm{Rel}_S(S,B,A)\\land\\forall x\\in A\\;\\forall y\\in B\\;(\\langle y,x\\rangle\\in S\\leftrightarrow\\langle x,y\\rangle\\in R)\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{df\\text{-}zfc\\text{-}inverse\\text{-}relation} \\vdash \\mathrm{ZfcSet10InverseRelation}_S(S,R,A,B)\\leftrightarrow\\mathrm{InverseRelation}_S(S,R,A,B)\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\mathrm{df\\text{-}zfc\\text{-}inverse\\text{-}relation} \\vdash \\mathrm{ZfcSet10InverseRelation}_S(S,R,A,B)\\leftrightarrow\\mathrm{InverseRelation}_S(S,R,A,B)\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{df\\text{-}zfc\\text{-}inverse\\text{-}relation} \\vdash \\mathrm{ZfcSetopInverseRelation}_S(R^{-1},R,A,B)\\leftrightarrow\\mathrm{InverseRelation}_S(R^{-1},R,A,B)\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\mathrm{df\\text{-}zfc\\text{-}inverse\\text{-}relation} \\vdash \\mathrm{ZfcSetopInverseRelation}_S(R^{-1},R,A,B)\\leftrightarrow\\mathrm{InverseRelation}_S(R^{-1},R,A,B)\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><h2 id=\"Remark\">[Remark]</h2>\n<ul>\n<li>The carriers bound both coordinates, and the sourced relation predicate rules out non-pair elements.</li>\n<li><code>58-df-zfc-set10-inverse-relation</code> and <code>58-df-zfc-setop-inverse-relation</code> are merged here.</li>\n</ul>\n","headings":[{"id":"Hypothesis","text":"[Hypothesis]","level":2},{"id":"Assertion","text":"[Assertion]","level":2},{"id":"Remark","text":"[Remark]","level":2}],"links":[{"target":"58-ax-zfc","status":"resolved","id":"a3348ed9eb6fb4e3","anchor":"ref-1","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[58-ax-zfc]]","embed":false},{"target":"58-df-relation","status":"resolved","id":"7ccfc8c88f29968a","anchor":"ref-2","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[58-df-relation]]","embed":false},{"target":"58-df-relation","status":"resolved","id":"7ccfc8c88f29968a","anchor":"ref-3","targetAnchor":"","location":"正文","heading":"[Hypothesis]","excerpt":"$\\mathrm{Rel}_S$ (binary-relation predicate; see [[58-df-relation]])","embed":false}],"math":[{"tex":"A,B,R,S\\in V","display":false},{"tex":"R^{-1}\\in V","display":false},{"tex":"x,y,a,b\\in V","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathrm{InverseRelation}_S","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathrm{ZfcSet10InverseRelation}_S","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathrm{ZfcSetopInverseRelation}_S","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathrm{Rel}_S","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathrm{df\\text{-}zfc\\text{-}inverse\\text{-}relation} \\vdash \\mathrm{InverseRelation}_S(S,R,A,B)\\leftrightarrow\\mathrm{Rel}_S(R,A,B)\\land\\mathrm{Rel}_S(S,B,A)\\land\\forall x\\in A\\;\\forall y\\in B\\;(\\langle y,x\\rangle\\in S\\leftrightarrow\\langle x,y\\rangle\\in R)","display":true},{"tex":"\\mathrm{df\\text{-}zfc\\text{-}inverse\\text{-}relation} \\vdash \\mathrm{ZfcSet10InverseRelation}_S(S,R,A,B)\\leftrightarrow\\mathrm{InverseRelation}_S(S,R,A,B)","display":true},{"tex":"\\mathrm{df\\text{-}zfc\\text{-}inverse\\text{-}relation} \\vdash \\mathrm{ZfcSetopInverseRelation}_S(R^{-1},R,A,B)\\leftrightarrow\\mathrm{InverseRelation}_S(R^{-1},R,A,B)","display":true}],"bytes":1639,"backlinks":[{"id":"62ea7cd84f64e253","anchor":"ref-7","locations":["元数据 · depends_on","正文"],"count":2,"excerpt":"$\\mathrm{InverseRelation}_S$ (逆关系图谓词, see [[../batch20/58-df-zfc-inverse-relation.md]])"},{"id":"ca566714b52a0471","anchor":"ref-9","locations":["元数据 · depends_on","正文"],"count":2,"excerpt":"$\\mathrm{ZfcRelComposition}_S$ and $\\mathrm{InverseRelation}_S$ are the relation-operation predicates (see [[../batch10/58-df-zfc-rel-composition.md]], [[../batch20/58-df-zfc-inverse-relation.md]])"},{"id":"84daad544872cc71","anchor":"ref-2391","locations":["正文"],"count":1,"excerpt":"[[../batch20/58-df-zfc-inverse-relation.md|58-df-zfc-inverse-relation]]（batch20）"}],"outgoing":["a3348ed9eb6fb4e3","7ccfc8c88f29968a"]}